        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova ma oga ma, ma ma ’ba ma dri ’ba Yeho­vani odu osule driniari ma ruaa ku; te ma zi mi tia, mi ’du aju eri ma dria ’diri, azini kerea yiniri be, ama mu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.26.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.26.11"
            ]
          }
        },
